hat are deployed lose the rule."},"1elLRhGK7ETb":{"name":"Precision Debuff","description":"Once per activation, before attacking, pick up to 3 enemy units within 18\\" in line of sight, which gets -1 to hit rolls when attacking once (next time the effect would apply)."},"2atvlmICQSCV":{"name":"Fearless","description":"When a unit where most models have this rule fails a Morale Test, roll one die. On a 4+ it counts as passed instead."},"3FeiOe3krHMa":{"name":"Aircraft","description":"May only use Advance actions, moving in a straight line, and adding 30\u201D to its total move (even if Shaken). Aircraft ignore all units and terrain when moving and stopping, can\u2019t seize or contest objectives, can\u2019t be charged, and units targeting them get -12\u201D range and -1 to hit rolls."},"3sXTViTVdDhn":{"name":"Predator Aura","description":"This model\'s unit and up to 2 friendly units picked before the start of the game get Predator. If this model is killed, picked models that are deployed lose the rule."},"47CAqf7ySlfc":{"name":"Caster","description":"Gets X spell tokens at the start of each round, but can\u2019t have more than 6 at once. Once per activation, before attacking, spend as many tokens as the spell\u2019s value to try casting one or more spells (only one try per spell). Pick a target and roll one die, and on 4+ resolve the spell\u2019s effect. Models within 18\u201D of the Caster may spend any number of spell tokens at the same time before rolling to give the Caster +1/-1 to the roll per token."},"4Q1owB6yNFz1":{"name":"Spell Amplifier","description":"Gets +1 to casting rolls."},"5v6oaGfrdf29":{"name":"Surge","description":"For each unmodified result of 6 to hit, this weapon deals 1 extra hit (only the original hit counts as a 6 for special rules)."},"62-mYKVM9MLd":{"name":"Impact","description":"When charging, before either unit attacks, roll X dice, unless this unit is Fatigued. For each 2+ the target takes 1 hit."},"6mJw5IdqSqNC":{"name":"Ambush","description":"May be set aside before deployment. At the start of any round after the first, may be deployed anywhere over 9\u201D away from enemy units. Players alternate in placing Ambush units, starting with the player that activates next. Units that deploy via Ambush can\u2019t seize or contest objectives on the round they deploy."},"8Ck9GAwUK824":{"name":"Indirect","description":"When using Hold actions and shooting, may target enemies that are not in line of sight as if in line of sight, and ignores Cover from Sight Blockers."},"8Hjy54TYtwb7":{"name":"Takedown","description":"This model may pick any model in the target unit as its individual target for this weapon\'s attacks, which is resolved as if it was a unit of [1]. Takedown attacks must be resolved before other weapons."},"8KujvrTG8k9p":{"name":"Regeneration","description":"When a unit where most models have this rule takes wounds, roll one die for each. On a 5+ it is ignored."},"9042COVrLCsI":{"name":"Limited","description":"May only be used once per game."},"9jyvRoBODD-O":{"name":"Stealth","description":"When units where most models have this rule are shot from over 9\\" away, enemy units get -1 to hit rolls."},"a0YtInGiUDd6":{"name":"Tough","description":"Once a model has taken as many wounds as its Tough value, it is killed (remove from play)."},"aiYEmCuDPUcM":{"name":"Predator","description":"For each unmodified roll of 6 to hit when attacking, this model may roll +1 attack with that weapon. This rule doesn\u2019t apply to newly generated attacks."},"anyZ2FHtdAVO":{"name":"Hit & Run Fighter","description":"Once per round, this model may move by up to 3\\" after being in melee."},"aogQZcOOQrDI":{"name":"Transport","description":"May transport up to X friendly models with Tough(3) or Heroes with up to Tough(18), and non-Heroes with up to Tough(9) which occupy 3 spaces each. Transports may deploy with units inside, and units may enter/exit by using any move action, getting within 2\u201D to enter, and staying fully within 6\u201D when exiting. Units inside/outside transports may not target other units that are outside/inside, but may target the transport itself. When a transport is destroyed, units inside must take a Dangerous Terrain Test, are Shaken, and must be placed fully within 6\u201D of the transport before it\u2019s removed."},"BOqSaZoY3ewJ":{"name":"Imprecise","description":"Gets -1 to hit when attacking."},"c45Fw0D2oGOk":{"name":"Counter","description":"May strike first with this weapon when charged, unless this unit is Fatigued."},"cavWDboL4ubs":{"name":"Rending","description":"Ignores Regeneration, and for each unmodified result of 6 to hit, those hits get AP(+4)."},"cgCroTrOmiv-":{"name":"Hive Bond","description":"If most models in this unit have this rule, they get +1 to Morale Test rolls when shot/charged from over 9\\"/6\\" away."},"CK9TIa7vdehO":{"name":"Furious Aura","description":"This model\'s unit and up to 2 friendly units picked before the start of the game get Furious. If this model is killed, picked models that are deployed lose the rule."},"cnKvLv8ErzIc":{"name":"Stealth Buff","description":"Once per activation, before attacking, pick up to 3 friendly units within 12\\", which gets Stealth once (next time the effect would apply)."},"CQes0mDvF4bV":{"name":"AP","description":"AP"},"DEeVIJcfNfS6":{"name":"Unpredictable Fighter","description":"When in melee, roll one die and apply one effect to all models with this rule: on a 1-3 they get AP(+1), and on a 4-6 they get +1 to hit rolls instead."},"dIQ3SGl2J2Ew":{"name":"Fear","description":"When in melee with this model, enemies count as having taken +X wounds when checking who won."},"djJahpu0Ciut":{"name":"Infiltrate","description":"Counts as having Ambush, but may be deployed anywhere over 3\\" away from enemy unit."},"efmjJPTe0Yzd":{"name":"Anti-Cover","description":"This weapon ignores Cover."},"F_1wfmpAyYwT":{"name":"Self-Destruct","description":"If this model is killed in melee, the attacking unit takes X hits. If this model survives melee, after both sides have finished attacking, it is immediately killed, and the enemy unit takes X hits."},"FAMbscK5vhSu":{"name":"Scout","description":"May be set aside before deployment. After all other units are deployed, may be deployed anywhere fully within 9\u201D of their deployment zone, over 9\u201D away from non-Scout enemy units. Players alternate in placing Scout units, starting with the player that activates next."},"FF5ddXgx75lI":{"name":"Assault","description":"Counts as both a ranged weapon and a melee weapon."},"GgPKQ4tKFRIC":{"name":"Unwieldy","description":"Strikes last when charging."},"GRuFoZiyjY5f":{"name":"Artillery","description":"When this model uses Hold actions and shoots at enemies over 12\u201D away, it gets +1 to hit rolls. If most models in this unit have this rule, as long as they haven\'t moved during this round, enemy units shooting at them from over 12\u201D away get -1 to hit rolls."},"h-Cj1XrX00JE":{"name":"Spell Resistance","description":"When a unit where most models have this rule takes wounds, roll one die for each. If the wound was from a spell, then it is ignored on a 2+. If the wound was not from a spell, then it is ignored on a 6+ instead."},"H9E9PIWpGRdw":{"name":"Relentless","description":"When this model shoots at enemies over 9\u201D away, unmodified result of 6 to hit deal 1 extra hit (only the original hit counts as a 6 for special rules)."},"HMiVg3VVLQv3":{"name":"Piercing Target","description":"Once per game, during this model\'s activation, before attacking, pick X enemy units within 18\\" and in line of sight of it, and place one token on them. Friendly units get AP(+1) on their weapons when attacking them."},"HWtnPV9LQF1D":{"name":"Immobile","description":"May only use Hold actions."},"IEJp3a4vE0CB":{"name":"Shred","description":"For each unmodified result of 1 to block hits, this weapon deals 1 extra wound."},"JoOCVPx1xT1G":{"name":"Furious","description":"When charging, unmodified result of 6 to hit deal 1 extra hit (only the original hit counts as a 6 for special rules)."},"JSKVyurtWIyW":{"name":"Strider","description":"May ignore the effects of Difficult terrain. This unit halves the number of dice it rolls when jumping (rounding up)."},"KdgwlPb8LuD2":{"name":"Fast","description":"Moves +2\u201D when using Advance, and +4\u201D when using Rush/Charge."},"kiXI7plPE_mK":{"name":"Enhanced Hive Bond","description":"If most models in this unit have Hive Bond, they always get +1 to Morale Test rolls from Hive Bond (instead of only when shot/charged from over 9\\"/6\\" away)."},"LbpquFUyGSZ7":{"name":"Valiant","description":"If most models in this unit have this rule, they get +1 to Morale Test rolls when shot/charged from over 9\\"/6\\" away."},"Ldhtmr4H8b6G":{"name":"Slow","description":"Moves -2\u201D when using Advance, and -4\u201D when using Rush/Charge."},"Naqc5mga9Uha":{"name":"Bane","description":"Ignores Regeneration, and when attacking, the target must re-roll unmodified Defense results of 6."},"nLQCr5OiSlYz":{"name":"Caster Group","description":"This model counts as having Caster(1)."},"O2Cd7OibBBA5":{"name":"No Retreat","description":"When a unit where most models have this rule fails a Morale Test that causes it to be Shaken or Routed, the test counts as passed instead. Then, roll as many dice as the number of wounds it would take to fully destroy it, and for each result of 1-3 the unit takes one wound, which can\'t be ignored."},"qrG_DXJez5Dg":{"name":"Musician","description":"This model\'s unit and up to 2 friendly units picked before the start of the game moves +1\\" when using move actions. If this model is killed, picked models that are deployed lose the rule."},"QWzGAg9RpE2D":{"name":"Increased Shooting Range Aura","description":"This model\'s unit and up to 2 friendly units picked before the start of the game get +6\\" range on its weapons when shooting. If this model is killed, picked models that are deployed lose the rule."},"QXyt-zV_bjpg":{"name":"Unstoppable","description":"This weapon ignores Regeneration, and ignores all negative modifiers which are not from this model\'s special rules."},"RHkw66BqDjUp":{"name":"Fragment","description":"When attacking units where most models have Defense 4+ to Defense 6+, the target must re-roll successful unmodified Defense results of 4-6."},"rqBYj1yANC3J":{"name":"Unique Hero","description":"Counts as having Hero, and this model may only be taken once per army."},"s4lagBUlnsUE":{"name":"Piercing Growth","description":"Place one token on this unit at the beginning of each round if it\'s on the table and isn\'t Shaken, up to a max. of four tokens. For every two tokens, models with this rule in this unit get AP(+1) on their weapons."},"s6MgSfmgylXU":{"name":"Defense","description":"This model gets +X to Defense rolls."},"T08VkBuVmNZ_":{"name":"Hero","description":"Units within 6\u201D of friendly Heroes may use the Hero\u2019s Quality for Morale Tests as long as the Hero isn\u2019t Shaken."},"TbjUdR-OJZPw":{"name":"Enhanced Valiant","description":"If most models in this unit have Valiant, they always get +1 to Morale Test rolls from Valiant (instead of only when shot/charged from over 9\\"/6\\" away)."},"umbiz4tnEyF8":{"name":"Thrust","description":"When charging, gets +1 to hit rolls and AP(+1) in melee."},"V3YzPPkZm8at":{"name":"Regeneration Aura","description":"This model\'s unit and up to 2 friendly units picked before the start of the game get Regeneration. If this model is killed, picked models that are deployed lose the rule."},"w_vX0mi58KKt":{"name":"Blast","description":"Ignores Cover, and after resolving other special rules, each hit is multiplied by X. Hits must be split evenly between the target and all enemy units within 3\u201D of any model from the target (defender picks how), but each unit may only take up to as many hits as models in it"},"WNMH1ZiQXSz-":{"name":"Spell Conduit","description":"Casters within 12\\"