ed before the start of the game get Bane on its weapons when shooting. If this model is killed, picked models that are deployed lose the rule."},"FRVSAjasmFSF":{"name":"Bravery Aura","description":"This model\'s unit and up to 2 friendly units picked before the start of the game get +1 to Morale Test rolls. If this model is killed, picked models that are deployed lose the rule."},"j93FkLXMCk8v":{"name":"Steadfast","description":"If a unit where most models have this rule is Shaken at the beginning of the round, roll one die. On a 4+, it stops being Shaken."},"mETdyZ__yMVj":{"name":"Mend","description":"Once per activation, before attacking, pick one friendly model within 3\\" with Tough, and remove D3 wounds from it."},"O_sf2rsHA7rD":{"name":"Evasive","description":"Enemies get -1 to hit rolls when attacking units where most models have this rule."},"qsx__9Cz3au_":{"name":"Rapid Rush","description":"This model moves +6\\" when using Rush actions."},"RDFhn43ktRx8":{"name":"Rapid Rush Aura","description":"This model\'s unit and up to 2 friendly units picked before the start of the game get Rapid Rush. If this model is killed, picked models that are deployed lose the rule."},"XoDRL2xVEnVf":{"name":"Bane in Melee Aura","description":"This model\'s unit and up to 2 friendly units picked before the start of the game get Bane on its weapons in melee. If this model is killed, picked models that are deployed lose the rule."},"y47PXwakTSji":{"name":"Versatile Reach","description":"When this unit is activated, pick one effect: until the end of the activation, all models with this rule in this unit either get +4\\" range when shooting or move +2\\" when charging."},"z4QuSO_AxqDr":{"name":"Versatile Expert","description":"When this unit is activated, pick one effect: until the end of the activation all models with this rule in this unit either get AP(+1) when attacking, or get +1 to hit rolls when attacking."},"zjzB46LX-QDg":{"name":"Re-Deployment","description":"After all other