odels with this rule in this unit at the beginning of the game. Friendly units get +X to hit rolls when attacking that unit, where X is the number of tokens on it."},"C6MzEy1CnxTs":{"name":"Repel Ambushers","description":"Enemy units using Ambush must be set up over 12\\" away from this model\'s unit."},"cU3RtuBXHyq4":{"name":"Blast","description":"If the target is hit all models within 4\u201C of it are also hit by this weapon."},"D-XBYhhRyp_N":{"name":"Enhanced Berserker Aura","description":"This model\'s unit and up to 2 friendly units picked before the start of the game get Enhanced Berserker. If this model is killed, picked models that are deployed lose the rule."},"EgdF_3MSddXR":{"name":"Melee Evasion","description":"Enemies get -1 to hit rolls in melee when attacking units where most models have this rule."},"fOIa9S1t0q7S":{"name":"Melee Evasion Aura","description":"This model\'s unit and up to 2 friendly units picked before the start of the game get Melee Evasion. If this model is killed, picked models that are deployed lose the rule."},"gOFh4u_LGrwP":{"name":"Ambush Aura","description":"This model\'s unit and up to 2 friendly units picked before the start of the game get Ambush. If this model is killed, picked models that are deployed lose the rule."},"h9JsgD38BRjI":{"name":"Bounding","description":"When this unit is activated, you may move all models with this rule in it by up to D3+1\\"."},"haWppj0rUxS8":{"name":"Badlands Hunter","description":"When this model shoots/charges enemies over 9\\"/6\\" away, unmodified results of 1 to block hits from weapons deal 1 extra wound."},"hnsVQyx3ylMf":{"name":"Ravage","description":"Once per round, when it\u2019s this model\u2019s turn to strike in melee, roll X dice before attacking, unless this unit is Fatigued. For each 6+ the target takes one wound."},"jQ4CmTsoXEnt":{"name":"Defense Debuff","description":"Once per activation, before attacking, pick up to 3 enemy units within 18\\" in line of sight, which gets -1 