":"Knight Prime Brothers","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"drqw1iswxmuugp3d","book":"Lust Disciples","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"7el7k3hgy5pb9o9i","book":"Machine Cults","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"1wj1ysgxpuuz9bc7","book":"Orc Marauders","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"jlray7cwf8mvw5sn","book":"Plague Disciples","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"oqnnu0gk8q6hyyny","book":"Prime Brothers","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"hk70l4d471plza00","book":"Ratmen Clans","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"5wbcv465hacdwvkb","book":"Rebel Guerrillas","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"4k5amkxoybdiqotm","book":"Robot Legions","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"U6hwlur14RpnInZr","book":"Saurian Starhosts","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"zz3kp5ry7ks6mxcx","book":"Soul-Snatcher Cults","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"3j10zage1lddt6sr","book":"Titan Lords","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"m0JXdcVTyo-WFrMF","book":"Titan Lords Change Disciples","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"YYIAF_LCwgJiyXYa","book":"Titan Lords Lust Disciples","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"bf20fNmJEyUS-PIX","book":"Titan Lords Plague Disciples","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"iV_3U33NE1_ZTXBB","book":"Titan Lords War Disciples","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"zpaY1LFqVk-ZJdvW","book":"Voidspace Stalkers","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"31xjrm9ivdimkjxp","book":"War Disciples","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"rvvb3kdn2x2pqkki","book":"Watch Brothers","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"rl7ympklz4r0ls38","book":"Watch Prime Brothers","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"yxjboa8oma9bbdck","book":"Wolf Brothers","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"e8mflytiz51kc4n6","book":"Wolf Prime Brothers","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"i4ZEAmqeFSfAcw3f","book":"Wormhole Daemons","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"}]},"rules":{"_BgATbpwgnxc":{"name":"Swift Buff","description":"Once per activation, before attacking, pick one friendly unit within 12\\", which gets Swift once (next time the effect would apply)."},"_mrPya5SXSqW":{"name":"Deadly","description":"Assign each wound to one model, and multiply it by X. Hits from Deadly must be resolved first, and these wounds don\u2019t carry over to other models if the original target is killed."},"_T07iXWo4VwJ":{"name":"Parry","description":"When this unit takes hits in melee, roll X dice per model with this rule in it, up to as many dice as hits taken. For each 6+ one hit is ignored (defender picks which)."},"_tP0jExjizvc":{"name":"Screened","description":"If most models in this unit have this rule, enemy units shooting/charging them from over 9\\"/6\\" away get -1 to hit rolls ."},"-05w6vRgH2k9":{"name":"Rending in Melee Aura","description":"This model and its unit get Rending on its weapons in melee."},"-6osYnOq7DGV":{"name":"Counter in Melee","description":"This model gets Counter on its weapons in melee."},"-eXDDTCrrQ6n":{"name":"Dodge","description":"If most models in this unit have this rule, as long as they aren\'t Fatigued, enemy units get -1 to hit rolls in melee against them."},"-QJdqJEKjIpE":{"name":"Flying","description":"May move through units and terrain, and ignores the effects of Difficult and Dangerous terrain."},"09SoiR1HuW7u":{"name":"Precise","description":"Gets +1 to hit when attacking."},"0B7GlGWBl7FF":{"name":"Enhanced Primal Buff","description":"Once per activation, before attacking, pick one friendly unit within 12\\", which gets Enhanced Primal once (next time the effect would apply)."},"0bcGY4Xr4NE0":{"name":"Brace","description":"Enemies charging this unit get -X total Impact rolls, unless this unit is Fatigued."},"0dZak5jae8F0":{"name":"Melee Shrouding Aura","description":"This model and its unit get Melee Shrouding."},"0TfnG5G4JEv0":{"name":"Anti-Regen","description":"This weapon ignores Regeneration."},"0Z-OGtDpajc3":{"name":"Grounded Evasion","description":"If a unit where most models have this rule has most of them within 1\\" of terrain, enemies get -1 to hit rolls when attacking them."},"0Za4ptEWX5hx":{"name":"Rapid Ambush","description":"Counts as having Ambush, but may be deployed at the start of any round, including the first."},"13WU-Xq3Pu8E":{"name":"Furious Buff","description":"Once per activation, before attacking, pick one friendly unit within 12\\", which gets Furious once (next time the effect would apply)."},"17crjK7P6_w6":{"name":"AP","description":"Targets get -X to Defense rolls when blocking hits."},"1BZ5wsWUjYCd":{"name":"Enhanced Scrapper","description":"If this model has Scrapper, enemies taking hits from it must re-roll successful unmodified Defense results of 5-6 from Scrapper (instead of only results of 6)."},"1cykqbg4xn6o":{"name":"Rapid Charge Aura","description":"This model and its unit moves +4\\" when using Charge actions."},"1elLRhGK7ETb":{"name":"Precision Debuff","description":"Once per activation, before attacking, pick one enemy unit within 18\\" in line of sight, which gets -1 to hit rolls when attacking once (next time the effect would apply)."},"1m7a9ADI-D_g":{"name":"Piercing Marksman Aura","description":"This model and its unit get Piercing Marksman."},"1PSCVoS08kVx":{"name":"Enhanced Lustbound","description":"If this model has Lustbound, it moves +2\\" on Advance and +4\\" on Rush/Charge from Lustbound (instead of only +1\\" and +2\\")."},"1qiGNqpxKb24":{"name":"Puncture","description":"Ignores Regeneration, and when attacking units where most models have Defense 2+ to Defense 3+, this weapon gets AP(+2)."},"1TMBPe40kx2b":{"name":"Melee Shrouding","description":"When a unit where most models have this rule is targeted by an enemy unit for charging, that enemy unit gets -2\\" range to a min. of 6\\"."},"21dbpSjSDeOY":{"name":"Clan Warrior","description":"For each unmodified roll of 6 to hit when attacking, this model may roll +1 attack with that weapon. This rule doesn\u2019t apply to newly generated attacks."},"249Oc2_1eOx6":{"name":"Shred in Melee","description":"This model gets Shred on its weapons in melee."},"27DHOeVHMwrj":{"name":"Slayer","description":"When using Hold actions and shooting, or when charging, this model\'s weapons get AP(+2) if most models in the target have Tough(3) or higher."},"2atvlmICQSCV":{"name":"Fearless","description":"When a unit where most models have this rule fails a Morale Test, roll one die. On a 4+ it counts as passed instead."},"2Cxml82Ma_3Y":{"name":"Enhanced Protected","description":"If most models in this unit have Protected, they ignore wounds on rolls of 5-6 from Protected (instead of only on 6+)."},"2hXA8X1Xlrmc":{"name":"Enhanced Shrouded","description":"If most models in this unit have Shrouded, enemy units shooting/charging it get -8\\"/-4\\" range to a min. of 6\\" from Shrouded (instead of only -4\\"/-2\\")."},"2xUH_d7T_Zfv":{"name":"Harassing","description":"Once per round, this model may move by up to 3\\" after shooting or being in melee."},"38s_V6mXkYX-":{"name":"Thrust in Melee Aura","description":"This model and its unit get Thrust on its weapons in melee."},"3FeiOe3krHMa":{"name":"Aircraft","description":"May only use Advance actions, moving in a straight line, and adding 30\u201D to its total move (even if Shaken). Aircraft ignore all units and terrain when moving and stopping, can\u2019t seize or contest objectives, can\u2019t be charged, and units targeting them get -12\u201D range and -1 to hit rolls."},"3oGVnDhS1udb":{"name":"Enhanced Shadowborn Aura","description":"This model and its unit get Enhanced Shadowborn."},"3RJ8ZvQphXk5":{"name":"Indirect when Shooting Aura","description":"This model and its unit get Indirect on its weapons when shooting."},"3sXTViTVdDhn":{"name":"Predator Aura","description":"This model and its unit get Predator."},"47CAqf7ySlfc":{"name":"Caster","description":"Gets X spell tokens at the start of each round, but can\u2019t have more than 6 at once. Once per activation, before attacking, spend as many tokens as the spell\u2019s value to try casting one or more spells (only one try per spell). Pick a target and roll one die, and on 4+ resolve the spell\u2019s effect. Models within 18\u201D of the Caster may spend any number of spell tokens at the same time before rolling to give the Caster +1/-1 to the roll per token."},"4cIuNtbAfWkF":{"name":"Unstoppable in Melee","description":"This model gets Unstoppable on its weapons in melee."},"4mB0rwGnMVgJ":{"name":"Changebound","description":"If most models in this unit have this rule, enemy units shooting/charging them from over 9\\"/6\\" away get -1 to hit rolls ."},"4NiNnvh-brLp":{"name":"Anti-Cover Aura","description":"This model and its unit get Anti-Cover on its weapons when shooting."},"4NMqPbqMvE4C":{"name":"Enhanced Hold the Line","description":"If most models in this unit have Hold the Line, they always get +1 to Morale Test rolls from Hold the Line (instead of only when shot/charged from over 9\\"/6\\" away)."},"4Q1owB6yNFz1":{"name":"Spell Amplifier","description":"Gets +1 to casting rolls."},"5_4ZsH9_q-tE":{"name":"Screened Aura","description":"This model and its unit get Screened."},"55Si47u6jTtb":{"name":"Entrenched Buff","description":"Once per activation, before attacking, pick one friendly unit within 12\\", which gets Entrenched once (next time the effect would apply)."},"5bc5xNmd5M14":{"name":"Highborn","description":"This model gets +4\\"/+2\\" range when shooting/charging."},"5G44ZDmQG-N5":{"name":"Enhanced Warbound","description":"If this model has Warbound, enemies always take wounds on unmodified results of 1 to block from Warbound (instead of only when shooting/charging enemies over 9\\"/6\\" away)."},"5grD2FDFdNSn":{"name":"Piercing Warrior","description":"When this model shoots/charges enemies over 9\\"/6\\" away, its weapons get AP(+1)."},"5L4WYDhAN6bU":{"name":"Grounded Defense","description":"If a unit where most models have this rule has most of them within 1\\" of terrain, they get +1 to Defense rolls."},"5NeMSSj7-Pp5":{"name":"Enhanced Violent","description":"If this model has Violent, enemies always take wounds on unmodified results of 1 to block from Violent (instead of only when shooting/charging enemies over 9\\"/6\\" away)."},"5v6oaGfrdf29":{"name":"Surge","description":"For each unmodified result of 6 to hit, this weapon deals 1 extra hit (only the original hit counts as a 6 for special rules)."},"62-mYKVM9MLd":{"name":"Impact","description":"When charging, before either unit attacks, roll X dice, unless this unit is Fatigued. For each 2+ the target takes 1 hit."},"6mJw5IdqSqNC":{"name":"Ambush","description":"May be set aside before deployment. At the start of any round after the first, may be deployed anywhere over 9\u201D away from enemy units. Players alternate in placing Ambush units, starting with the player that activates next. Units that deploy via Ambush can\u2019t seize or contest objectives on the round they deploy."},"6Nn0oPQN3TZc":{"name":"Enhanced Highborn","description":"If this model has Highborn, it gets +8\\"/+4\\" range when shooting/charging from Highborn (instead of only +4\\"/+2\\")."},"7-nw0-TRmYAv":{"name":"Enhanced Guardian","description":"If most models in this unit have Guardian, hits they take count as having AP(-2) from Guardian (instead of only AP(-1))."},"741uN_Qma5mL":{"name":"Battleborn","description":"If a unit where most models have this rule is Shaken at the beginning of the round, roll one die. On a 4+, it stops being Shaken."},"74RjQ1k41DoO":{"name":"Armor","description":"Counts as having Defense X+."},"7F4391rzKx2g":{"name":"Obliterate","description":"Ignores Regeneration, and when attacking units where most models have Tough(3) or higher, the target must re-roll successful unmodified Defense results of 4-6."},"7QCXafSRhLAS":{"name":"Enhanced Primal","description":"If this model has Primal, it gets extra attacks on successful unmodified hit results of 5-6 from Primal (instead of only on 6)."},"7sq95Nqfi4lG":{"name":"Enhanced Self-Repair Buff","description":"Once per activation, before attacking, pick one friendly unit within 12\\", which gets Enhanced Self-Repair once (next time the effect would apply)."},"8Ai6vFN7Ut6E":{"name":"Enhanced Agile","description":"If this model has Agile, it moves +2\\" on Advance and +4\\" on Rush/Charge from Agile (instead of only +1\\" and +2\\")."},"8Ck9GAwUK824":{"name":"Indirect","description":"When using Hold actions and shooting, may target enemies that are not in line of sight as if in line of sight, and ignores Cover from Sight Blockers."},"8cqDBbHGSA4m":{"name":"Demolish","description":"Ignores Cover, and when attacking units with most models within 1\\" of terrain, this weapon gets AP(+1)."},"8haZ36fXvnzn":{"name":"Stealth Aura","description":"This model and its unit get Stealth."},"8Hjy54TYtwb7":{"name":"Takedown","description":"This model may pick any model in the target unit as its individual target for this weapon\'s attacks, which is resolved as if it was a unit of [1]. Takedown attacks must be resolved before other weapons."},"8HWdOwMYcI0p":{"name":"Sergeant","description":"This model gets AP(+1) when attacking."},"8KujvrTG8k9p":{"name":"Regeneration","description":"When a unit where most models have this rule takes wounds, roll one die for each. On a 5+ it is ignored."},"8zBpM3Wjey08":{"name":"Unpredictable Fighter Aura","description":"This model and its unit get Unpredictable Fighter."},"9042COVrLCsI":{"name":"Limited","description":"May only be used once per game."},"95k3zdp_EzoN":{"name":"Enhanced Screened","description":"If most models in this unit have Screened, enemies attacking them always get -1 to hit rolls from Screened (instead of only when shooting/charging from over 9\\"/6\\" away)."},"97aE8SunQBTq":{"name":"Purge","description":"When attacking units that are Shaken or Fatigued, this weapon gets AP(+2)."},"99DXMN96LnI8":{"name":"Surprise Attack","description":"Counts as having Infiltrate. The first time this unit is activated, pick one enemy unit within 6\\" in line of sight, and roll X dice. For each 2+ it takes one hit with AP(1)."},"9jyvRoBODD-O":{"name":"Stealth","description":"When units where most models have this rule are shot from over 9\\" away, enemy units get -1 to hit rolls."},"9o03izVMZ-Xl":{"name":"Smash","description":"When attacking units over half of this weapon\'s range away, the target must re-roll unmodified Defense results of 6."},"9Te72f48wJyw":{"name":"Versatile Warrior","description":"When this unit is activated, pick one effect: until the end of the activation, when shooting/charging enemies over 9\\"/6\\" away, all models with this rule in it either get AP(+1) or get +1 to hit rolls."},"a0YtInGiUDd6":{"name":"Tough","description":"This model must take X wounds before being killed. If a model with Tough joins a unit without it, then it is removed last when the unit takes wounds. You must continue to put wounds on the Tough model with most wounds in the unit until it is killed, before starting to put them on the next Tough model (Heroes must be assigned wounds last, even if already wounded)."},"a1ewN99UxVcB":{"name":"Counter in Melee Buff","description":"Once per activation, before attacking, pick one friendly unit within 12\\", which gets Counter in Melee."},"a6Ze2uaBlNHX":{"name":"Mind Control","description":"Once per activation, before attacking, pick one enemy unit within 18\\" in line of sight, which must take a Morale Test. If failed you may move it by up to 6\\" in a straight line in any direction. Each unit may only be moved once per round in this way."},"a9j1Pje6TLBi":{"name":"Quick Shot Aura","description":"This model and its unit get Quick Shot."},"AB3FAl-SEUYP":{"name":"Unstoppable in Melee Aura","description":"This model and its unit get Unstoppable on its weapons in melee."},"ad6BHtI2eeX0":{"name":"Pierce","description":"Ignores all positive Defense modifiers on the target, and when attacking units over half of this weapon\'s range away, this weapon gets AP(+1)."},"af-WuhTCCUVk":{"name":"Piercing Shooting Mark","description":"Once per activation, before attacking, pick one enemy unit within 18\\" in line of sight, which friendly units gets AP(+1) on their weapons when shooting against once (next time the effect would apply)."},"AfGDQgn8r8O1":{"name":"Rending when Shooting Aura","description":"This model and its unit get Rending on its weapons when shooting."},"aiYEmCuDPUcM":{"name":"Predator","description":"For each unmodified roll of 6 to hit when attacking, this model may roll +1 attack with that weapon. This rule doesn\u2019t apply to newly generated attacks."},"Ajazu0ij2v5q":{"name":"Unpredictable Fighter Mark","description":"Once per activation, before attacking, pick one enemy unit within 18\\" in line of sight, which friendly units gets Unpredictable Fighter against once (next time the effect would apply)."},"AlIZbh-afBYi":{"name":"Protected","description":"When a unit where most models have this rule takes wounds, roll one die for each. On a 6+ it is ignored."},"amQphBHWOeJs":{"name":"Swift Aura","description":"This model and its unit get Swift."},"Anx9Iim2k-Ws":{"name":"Enhanced Warding","description":"If most models in this unit have Warding, they always ignore shooting/charging wounds on rolls of 6+ from Warding (instead of only when shot/charged from over 9\\"/6\\" away)."},"anyZ2FHtdAVO":{"name":"Hit & Run Fighter","description":"Once per round, this model may move by up to 3\\" after being in melee."},"aogQZcOOQrDI":{"name":"Transport","description":"May transport up to X friendly models or Heroes with up to Tough(6), and non-Heroes with up to Tough(3) which occupy 3 spaces each. Transports may deploy with units inside, and units may enter/exit by using any move action, getting within 2\u201D to enter, and staying fully within 6\u201D when exiting. Units inside/outside transports may not target other units that are outside/inside, but may target the transport itself