ts in melee, roll X dice per model with this rule in it, up to as many dice as hits taken. For each 6+ one hit is ignored (defender picks which)."},"_tP0jExjizvc":{"name":"Screened","description":"If most models in this unit have this rule, enemy units shooting/charging them from over 9\\"/6\\" away get -1 to hit rolls ."},"-05w6vRgH2k9":{"name":"Rending in Melee Aura","description":"This model and its unit get Rending on its weapons in melee."},"-3DT6QcQoxeg":{"name":"Enhanced Steadfast","description":"If most models in this unit have Steadfast, they stops being Shaken on rolls of 3+ from Steadfast (instead of only on 4+)."},"-6osYnOq7DGV":{"name":"Counter in Melee","description":"This model gets Counter on its weapons in melee."},"-7w3e1QuLK47":{"name":"Destroyer","description":"When this model shoots/charges enemies over 9\\"/6\\" away, unmodified results of 1 to block hits from weapons deal 1 extra wound."},"-eXDDTCrrQ6n":{"name":"Dodge","description":"If most models in this unit have this rule, as long as they aren\'t Fatigued, enemy units get -1 to hit rolls in melee against them."},"-QJdqJEKjIpE":{"name":"Flying","description":"May move through units and terrain, and ignores the effects of Difficult and Dangerous terrain."},"09_5wJQE8j1s":{"name":"Vale Oath","description":"If a unit where most models have this rule is Shaken at the beginning of the round, roll one die. On a 4+, it stops being Shaken."},"09SoiR1HuW7u":{"name":"Precise","description":"Gets +1 to hit when attacking."},"0B7GlGWBl7FF":{"name":"Enhanced Primal Buff","description":"Once per activation, before attacking, pick one friendly unit within 12\\", which gets Enhanced Primal once (next time the effect would apply)."},"0bcGY4Xr4NE0":{"name":"Brace","description":"Enemies charging this unit get -X total Impact rolls, unless this unit is Fatigued."},"0dZak5jae8F0":{"name":"Melee Shrouding Aura","description":"This model and its unit get Melee Shrouding."},"0TfnG5G4JEv0":{"name":"Anti-Regen","de