ok":"Sky-City Dwarves","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"qABIfXYbYxmA75yL","book":"Vampiric Undead","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"Ir5XtqTM8JS3YEAJ","book":"Volcanic Dwarves","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"TjNtGnCDVts3l3ER","book":"War Disciples","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"cF1dpwd4bhYsNhsf","book":"Brute Clans","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"T0CE9PUv4YDjbrjJ","book":"Crazed Zealots","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"ZORJcHSuqj4T4QP3","book":"Furious Tribes","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"UoKhifSWLDV8894b","book":"Guilds of the Nexus","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"TngTE5FtTZNKEHuG","book":"Hidden Syndicates","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"_6i8hfKF0YvVL2K4","book":"Hired Guards","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"n_YscnPzKx93ekFl","book":"Mercenaries","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"kQRIk8Zu_bQ58pnB","book":"Merchant Unions","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"bNSIMUiXr93FhqJE","book":"Outskirt Raiders","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"4ZMoS6P-3zRZUl51","book":"Shortling Alliances","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"Bsir5TSffxMozeGY","book":"Trade Federations","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"},{"armyId":"4SBY8ONErd3HUxle","book":"Treasure Hunters","collectedAt":"2026-11-09"}]},"rules":{"_mrPya5SXSqW":{"name":"Deadly","description":"Assign each wound to one model, and multiply it by X. Hits from Deadly must be resolved first, and these wounds don\u2019t carry over to other models if the original target is killed."},"_T07iXWo4VwJ":{"name":"Parry","description":"When this unit takes hits in melee, roll X dice per model with this rule in it, up to as many dice as hits taken. For each 6+ one hit is ignored (defender picks which)."},"-eXDDTCrrQ6n":{"name":"Dodge","description":"If most models in this unit have this rule, as long as they aren\'t Fatigued, enemy units get -1 to hit rolls in melee against them."},"-QJdqJEKjIpE":{"name":"Flying","description":"May move through units and terrain, and ignores the effects of Difficult and Dangerous terrain it doesn\u2019t start its move in.This unit automatically passes jumping rolls."},"09SoiR1HuW7u":{"name":"Precise","description":"Gets +1 to hit when attacking."},"0bcGY4Xr4NE0":{"name":"Brace","description":"Enemies charging this unit get -X total Impact rolls, unless this unit is Fatigued."},"0TfnG5G4JEv0":{"name":"Anti-Regen","description":"This weapon ignores Regeneration."},"17crjK7P6_w6":{"name":"AP","description":"Targets get -X to Defense rolls when blocking hits."},"2atvlmICQSCV":{"name":"Fearless","description":"When a unit where most models have this rule fails a Morale Test, roll one die. On a 4+ it counts as passed instead."},"2hXA8X1Xlrmc":{"name":"Enhanced Shrouded","description":"If most models in this unit have Shrouded, enemy units shooting/charging it get -8\\"/-4\\" range to a min. of 6\\" from Shrouded (instead of only -4\\"/-2\\")."},"3FeiOe3krHMa":{"name":"Aircraft","description":"May only use Advance actions, moving in a straight line, and adding 30\u201D to its total move (even if Shaken). Aircraft ignore all units and terrain when moving and stopping, can\u2019t seize or contest objectives, can\u2019t be charged, and units targeting them get -12\u201D range and -1 to hit rolls."},"47CAqf7ySlfc":{"name":"Caster","description":"Gets X spell tokens at the start of each round, but can\u2019t have more than 6 at once. Once per activation, before attacking, spend as many tokens as the spell\u2019s value to try casting one or more spells (only one try per spell). Pick a target and roll one die, and on 4+ resolve the spell\u2019s effect. Models within 18\u201D of the Caster may spend any number of spell tokens at the same time before rolling to give the Caster +1/-1 to the roll per token."},"4Q1owB6yNFz1":{"name":"Spell Amplifier","description":"Gets +1 to casting rolls."},"4rzxsYvWU9Ge":{"name":"Wild Veil","description":"When a unit where most models have this rule is targeted by an enemy unit for shooting/charging, that enemy unit gets -4\\"/-2\\" range to a min. of 6\\"."},"5L4WYDhAN6bU":{"name":"Grounded Defense","description":"If a unit where most models have this rule has most of them within 1\\" of terrain, they get +1 to Defense rolls."},"5v6oaGfrdf29":{"name":"Surge","description":"For each unmodified result of 6 to hit, this weapon deals 1 extra hit (only the original hit counts as a 6 for special rules)."},"62-mYKVM9MLd":{"name":"Impact","description":"When charging, before either unit attacks, roll X dice, unless this unit is Fatigued. For each 2+ the target takes 1 hit."},"6mJw5IdqSqNC":{"name":"Ambush","description":"May be set aside before deployment. At the start of any round after the first, may be deployed anywhere over 9\u201D away from enemy units. Players alternate in placing Ambush units, starting with the player that activates next. Units that deploy via Ambush can\u2019t seize or contest objectives on the round they deploy."},"74RjQ1k41DoO":{"name":"Armor","description":"Counts as having Defense X+."},"8Ck9GAwUK824":{"name":"Indirect","description":"When using Hold actions and shooting, may target enemies that are not in line of sight as if in line of sight, and ignores Cover from Sight Blockers."},"8Hjy54TYtwb7":{"name":"Takedown","description":"This model may pick any model in the target unit as its individual target for this weapon\'s attacks, which is resolved as if it was a unit of [1]. Takedown attacks must be resolved before other weapons."},"8HWdOwMYcI0p":{"name":"Sergeant","description":"This model gets AP(+1) when attacking."},"8KujvrTG8k9p":{"name":"Regeneration","description":"When a unit where most models have this rule takes wounds, roll one die for each. On a 5+ it is ignored."},"9042COVrLCsI":{"name":"Limited","description":"May only be used once per game."},"9jyvRoBODD-O":{"name":"Stealth","description":"When units where most models have this rule are shot from over 9\\" away, enemy units get -1 to hit rolls."},"9o03izVMZ-Xl":{"name":"Smash","description":"When attacking units over half of this weapon\'s range away, the target must re-roll unmodified Defense results of 6."},"a0YtInGiUDd6":{"name":"Tough","description":"Once a model has taken as many wounds as its Tough value, it is killed (remove from play)."},"aogQZcOOQrDI":{"name":"Transport","description":"May transport up to X friendly models with Tough(3) or Heroes with up to Tough(18), and non-Heroes with up to Tough(9) which occupy 3 spaces each. Transports may deploy with units inside, and units may enter/exit by using any move action, getting within 2\u201D to enter, and staying fully within 6\u201D when exiting. Units inside/outside transports may not target other units that are outside/inside, but may target the transport itself. When a transport is destroyed, units inside must take a Dangerous Terrain Test, are Shaken, and must be placed fully within 6\u201D of the transport before it\u2019s removed."},"c45Fw0D2oGOk":{"name":"Counter","description":"May strike first with this weapon when charged, unless this unit is Fatigued."},"C6MzEy1CnxTs":{"name":"Repel Ambushers","description":"Enemy units using Ambush must be set up over 12\\" away from this model\'s unit."},"cavWDboL4ubs":{"name":"Rending","description":"Ignores Regeneration, and for each unmodified result of 6 to hit, those hits get AP(+4)."},"CQes0mDvF4bV":{"name":"AP","description":"AP"},"DEeVIJcfNfS6":{"name":"Unpredictable Fighter","description":"When in melee, roll one die and apply one effect to all models with this rule: on a 1-3 they get AP(+1), and on a 4-6 they get +1 to hit rolls instead."},"DhLjIDRrWz6-":{"name":"Piercing Charge","description":"This model gets AP(+1) on its weapons when charging."},"dIQ3SGl2J2Ew":{"name":"Fear","description":"When in melee with this model, enemies count as having taken +X wounds when checking who won."},"efmjJPTe0Yzd":{"name":"Anti-Cover","description":"This weapon ignores Cover."},"EgdF_3MSddXR":{"name":"Melee Evasion","description":"Enemies get -1 to hit rolls in melee when attacking units where most models have this rule."},"eOGs64JpVsP3":{"name":"Unpredictable Shooter","description":"When shooting, roll one die and apply one effect to all models with this rule: on a 1-3 they get AP(+1), and on a 4-6 they get +1 to hit rolls instead."},"FAMbscK5vhSu":{"name":"Scout","description":"May be set aside before deployment. After all other units are deployed, may be deployed anywhere fully within 9\u201D of their deployment zone, over 9\u201D away from non-Scout enemy units. Players alternate in placing Scout units, starting with the player that activates next."},"FF5ddXgx75lI":{"name":"Assault","description":"Counts as both a ranged weapon and a melee weapon."},"fOIa9S1t0q7S":{"name":"Melee Evasion Aura","description":"This model\'s unit and up to 2 friendly units picked before the start of the game get Melee Evasion. If this model is killed, picked models that are deployed lose the rule."},"fzL4O9OzK3bS":{"name":"Enhanced Wild Veil Aura","description":"This model\'s unit and up to 2 friendly units picked before the start of the game get Enhanced Wild Veil. If this model is killed, picked models that are deployed lose the rule."},"GRuFoZiyjY5f":{"name":"Artillery","description":"When this model uses Hold actions and shoots at enemies over 12\u201D away, it gets +1 to hit rolls. If most models in this unit have this rule, as long as they haven\'t moved during this round, enemy units shooting at them from over 12\u201D away get -1 to hit rolls."},"gZeSKicKfxez":{"name":"Grounded Protection","description":"If a unit where most models have this rule has most of them within 1\\" of terrain, when they take wounds roll one die per wound, and on a 5+ it is ignored."},"h-Cj1XrX00JE":{"name":"Spell Resistance","description":"When a unit where most models have this rule takes wounds, roll one die for each. If the wound was from a spell, then it is ignored on a 2+. If the wound was not from a spell, then it is ignored on a 6+ instead."},"H9E9PIWpGRdw":{"name":"Relentless","description":"When this model shoots at enemies over 9\u201D away, unmodified result of 6 to hit deal 1 extra hit (only the original hit counts as a 6 for special rules)."},"HmxkJq_My-Ub":{"name":"Rapid Advance","description":"This model moves +4\\" when using Advance actions."},"HWtnPV9LQF1D":{"name":"Immobile","description":"May only use Hold actions."},"i40cKJoXJ7zm":{"name":"Unpredictable","description":"When attacking, roll one die and apply one effect to all models with this rule: on a 1-3 they get AP(+1), and on a 4-6 they get +1 to hit rolls instead."},"IEJp3a4vE0CB":{"name":"Shred","description":"For each unmodified result of 1 to block hits, this weapon deals 1 extra wound."},"JoOCVPx1xT1G":{"name":"Furious","description":"When charging, unmodified result of 6 to hit deal 1 extra hit (only the original hit counts as a 6 for special rules)."},"JSKVyurtWIyW":{"name":"Strider","description":"May ignore the effects of Difficult terrain. This unit halves the number of dice it rolls when jumping (rounding up)."},"KdgwlPb8LuD2":{"name":"Fast","description":"Moves +2\u201D when using Advance, and +4\u201D when using Rush/Charge."},"L--qMjlm2g4Q":{"name":"Piercing Charge Aura","description":"This model\'s unit and up to 2 friendly units picked before the start of the game get Piercing Charge. If this model is killed, picked models that are deployed lose the rule."},"Ldhtmr4H8b6G":{"name":"Slow","description":"Moves -2\u201D when using Advance, and -4\u201D when using Rush/Charge."},"LtPyHi_-DHf4":{"name":"Teleport","description":"Once per activation, before attacking, you may place this model anywhere fully within 3\\" of its position when using Advance/Charge actions, or fully within 6\\" of its position when using Rush actions."},"Naqc5mga9Uha":{"name":"Bane","description":"Ignores Regeneration, and when attacking, the target must re-roll unmodified Defense results o